msgstr "Richtlinie (EU) 2019/882 - European Accessibility Act (wo anwendbar)"

#: includes/class-livqacea-statement.php:803
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This organization qualifies as a microenterprise (fewer than 10 employees "
